│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 1: February 14th - Arrival in Madrid**                                                   │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Arrive at Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD)                                         │
│  * Take a taxi or metro to your hotel                                                           │
│  * Check-in at Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa (€80 per night)                       │
│  * Visit the nearby Plaza Mayor, a historic square surrounded by cafes, shops, and street       │
│  performers                                                                                     │
│  * Enjoy traditional Spanish cuisine for dinner at El Qu Jetcho                                 │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 2: February 15th - Museo del Prado**                                                     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Spend the morning exploring the world-renowned Museo del Prado (€16 per person)              │
│  * Visit the adjacent Royal Palace of Madrid (€13.50 per person)                                │
│  * Relax in the afternoon with a stroll through Retiro Park                                     │
│  * Enjoy tapas and local wines at La Latina                                                     │
│  * Overnight stay at Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa                                 │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 3: February 16th - Mercado de San Miguel**                                               │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Visit the historic Mercado de San Miguel (free entry)                                        │
│  * Sample local cuisine, including croquetas, tortilla española, and jamón ibérico              │
│  * Explore the nearby Puerta del Sol, a famous square with street performers and cafes          │
│  * Enjoy dinner at El Patajo, a Michelin-starred restaurant                                     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 4: February 17th - Carnaval de Madrid**                                                  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Participate in the lively festivities of Carnaval de Madrid (free entry)                     │
│  * Visit the adjacent Museo Reina Sofia (€12 per person), featuring modern Spanish art          │
│  * Explore the trendy Malasaña neighborhood, known for its street art and nightlife             │
│  * Enjoy a flamenco show at Tablao Flamenco Cardamomo                                           │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 5: February 18th - Day Trip to Toledo**                                                  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Take a day trip to the UNESCO World Heritage Site of Toledo (€10 per person)                 │
│  * Explore the historic city center, including the Cathedral and Alcázar                        │
│  * Return to Madrid in the evening and enjoy dinner at La Tasquita de Enfrente                  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 6: February 19th - Royal Opera House**                                                   │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Attend a performance at the iconic Teatro Real (€30-€100 per person)                         │
│  * Visit the adjacent Museum of Music (€7.50 per person)                                        │
│  * Enjoy a relaxing evening stroll through El Cortijo Park                                      │
│  * Overnight stay at Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa                                 │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Day 7: February 20th - Farewell to Madrid**                                                  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Spend the morning shopping for souvenirs or exploring the city center                        │
│  * Visit the nearby Plaza de Cibeles, a beautiful square with cafes and street performers       │
│  * Depart from Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD)                                       │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Budget Breakdown:**                                                                          │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Flights: €220-€300 return (Lufthansa, Iberia, or Ryanair)                                    │
│  * Accommodation: €560-€700 for 7 nights (€80 per night at Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio   │
